# Walk a level for 2 minutes, dumping guest RAM every 10 s, to watch the Hare
# Krishna line spawn (docs/M6B_KRISHNA_TEST_PLAN.md). Read the dumps with
#     python3 tools/dosprobe/gta8.py krishna OUT/r*.bin
# The walk is special_groups_walk.probe's: 8 s up, a quarter-second right, again.
# Liberty City (no overlay): the line spawned at 52 s; San Andreas [102] and
# Vice City [202] (level_overlay.py --section N): between 50 and 60 s; the
# synthetic `arena`: by 20 s. Each dump is 10 MB, which holds the page tables.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80
19000 shot start
19100 down up
19200 memdump r00 0 a00000
19201 shot f00
27100 up up
27200 down right
27456 up right
27556 down up
29200 memdump r01 0 a00000
29201 shot f01
35556 up up
35656 down right
35912 up right
36012 down up
39200 memdump r02 0 a00000
39201 shot f02
44012 up up
44112 down right
44368 up right
44468 down up
